<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Interview Scorecard: {{ candidate_name }} — {{ role }}</title>
<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}
body{margin:0 auto;max-width:52rem;padding:2rem 1.25rem;
font:16px/1.6 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,sans-serif;
color:#1b1b1b;background:#fff}
h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6{line-height:1.25;margin:2rem 0 .6rem}
h1{font-size:1.9rem} h2{font-size:1.45rem} h3{font-size:1.15rem}
p,ul,ol,blockquote,table,pre{margin:0 0 1rem}
code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.9em;
background:#f2f2f2;padding:.1em .3em;border-radius:3px}
pre{background:#f6f6f6;padding:.9rem 1rem;border-radius:5px;overflow-x:auto}
pre code{background:none;padding:0}
blockquote{border-left:3px solid #d0d0d0;margin-left:0;padding-left:1rem;
color:#4a4a4a}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;display:block;overflow-x:auto}
th,td{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:.4rem .6rem;text-align:left}
th{background:#f6f6f6}
hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid #ddd;margin:2rem 0}
a{color:#0b57d0}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){
body{color:#e6e6e6;background:#151515}
code{background:#242424} pre{background:#1d1d1d}
th{background:#1d1d1d} th,td{border-color:#333}
blockquote{border-left-color:#3a3a3a;color:#b0b0b0} a{color:#8ab4f8}}</style></head>
<body>
<h1>Interview Scorecard: {{ candidate_name }} — {{ role }}</h1>
<p><strong>Interviewer:</strong> {{ name }} <strong>Interview date:</strong> {{ interview_date }} <strong>Interview stage:</strong> {{ interview_stage }} <strong>Competencies covered:</strong> [list 2-3 from the role's competency table]</p>
<hr/>
<h2>Competency Scores</h2>
<h3>Competency 1: [e.g., Ownership]</h3>
<p><strong>Score:</strong> [ ] 1 — No evidence  [ ] 2 — Weak  [ ] 3 — Meets bar  [ ] 4 — Strong  [ ] 5 — Exceptional</p>
<p><strong>Behavioral anchors:</strong></p>
<ul><li>Score 1: Could not give a specific past example of taking ownership</li><li>Score 3: Gave a complete STAR example; outcome was meaningful but not exceptional</li><li>Score 5: Drove a critical outcome independently; quantified impact; shows pattern across multiple examples</li></ul>
<p><strong>Evidence (verbatim quote or described action — no impressions):</strong></p>
<blockquote><p>&quot;[Quote here]&quot;</p></blockquote>
<p><strong>Missing components (if any):</strong> [ ] Situation  [ ] Task  [ ] Action  [ ] Result</p>
<hr/>
<h3>Competency 2: [e.g., Technical Depth]</h3>
<p><strong>Score:</strong> [ ] 1  [ ] 2  [ ] 3  [ ] 4  [ ] 5</p>
<p><strong>Evidence:</strong></p>
<blockquote><p></p></blockquote>
<p><strong>Missing components:</strong> [ ] Situation  [ ] Task  [ ] Action  [ ] Result</p>
<hr/>
<h3>Competency 3: [e.g., Collaboration]</h3>
<p><strong>Score:</strong> [ ] 1  [ ] 2  [ ] 3  [ ] 4  [ ] 5</p>
<p><strong>Evidence:</strong></p>
<blockquote><p></p></blockquote>
<p><strong>Missing components:</strong> [ ] Situation  [ ] Task  [ ] Action  [ ] Result</p>
<hr/>
<h2>Overall Assessment</h2>
<p><strong>Weighted score:</strong> [compute from competency weights × scores]</p>
<p><strong>Hire recommendation:</strong> [ ] Strong Yes  [ ] Yes  [ ] Maybe — needs: ___________  [ ] No  [ ] Strong No</p>
<p><strong>Key strengths (must cite specific example):</strong> 1. 2.</p>
<p><strong>Areas of concern (must cite specific gap):</strong> 1. 2.</p>
<p><strong>Questions for next round or reference check:</strong> - -</p>
<hr/>
<h2>Pre-Submit Checklist</h2>
<ul><li>[ ] All competencies scored</li><li>[ ] Every score &gt;= 4 has verbatim evidence</li><li>[ ] No impression-only language (&quot;seemed&quot;, &quot;felt&quot;, &quot;liked&quot;)</li><li>[ ] No protected-class references</li><li>[ ] Submitted BEFORE reading peer scorecards</li></ul>
</body></html>
